    "memory_preserving_route": "Prior host IOPstatus1 or2, absent running property selects startCPUWithOptions0; ordinal0/1/2 preserves framework memory. Preloaded map/fixup skips DATA copy, and runCPU(true) fresh-ORs CTRL44 bit0x10.",
    "handshake": "Native management dispatch requires HELLO in host status4, selects12 and enters5 before reply; rollcall requires5 and successful final ACK before hoststatus6. Normal started validation expects6.",
    "second_management_basis": "Native requestPowerState is a direct ordinal table send with no app-root prerequisite in its bounded body. PWRGATE ordinal2 enters hoststatus7 before request0x202, and own ACK low8{1,2} normalizes to2. Fresh HELLO/final-map plus local register/accounting admission supports this management-only hypothesis.",
    "application_limit": "Native full ON still performs separate endpoint/AP callbacks and metadata handling, which this probe does not reproduce. Framework memory preservation does not establish retained GPU UAT/context state, reset-vector restoration, app rejoin or whole-GPU DMA retirement."
  },
